# out/ chua artefact tai tao duoc (facts, blocked, report) NEN bo qua,
# NHUNG out/matches.jsonl chua QUYET DINH CUA NGUOI GAC CONG, khong tai tao duoc.
# Bo sot dieu nay tu thang 7; phat hien 16/08/2026 khi commit thay "nothing to commit".
# LUU Y KY THUAT: phai dung "out/*" chu KHONG phai "out/". Git khong di vao thu muc
# da bi loai, nen "!out/matches.jsonl" sau "out/" hoan toan vo tac dung (da thu, van bi loai).
out/*
!out/matches.jsonl
__pycache__/
